/E (The present study is designed to systematically evaluate the hepatoprotective potential of Pergularia daemia using an in-vitro experimental model that simulates liver cirrhosis conditions. The primary objective of this research is to investigate the ability of the plant extract to protect hepatocyte cells from chemically induced toxicity and to assess its effectiveness in maintaining cellular integrity and function. A key focus of the study is to analyze the protective effect of Pergularia daemia by measuring important biological parameters such as cell viability, leakage of liver-specific enzymes, and levels of oxidative )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
