/E (The extraction of bioactive compounds from Pergularia daemia leaves was carried out using the cold extraction method, which is widely employed for efficient and continuous extraction of phytochemicals \(Prakash et al., 2022\). The dried and powdered plant material was accurately weighed and placed in a thimble made of filter paper. The extraction process was performed by heating the solvent to its boiling point, allowing it to evaporate and condense back into the extraction chamber containing the plant material. )
