/P 648 0 R
/E (Higher MDA levels indicate increased oxidative damage to cell membranes \(Mehta et al., 2022\). A decrease in MDA levels in treated cells suggests that the extract helps in preserving membrane integrity. Together, these assays provided a comprehensive evaluation of the hepatoprotective effect of Pergularia daemia under in-vitro conditions. )
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [4]
>>
