/P 649 0 R
/E (The MTT assay was performed to evaluate the viability of HepG2 cells following induction of hepatotoxicity and subsequent treatment with Pergularia daemia extract. The results presented in Table 1 clearly indicate that exposure to the toxic agent caused a significant decline in cell viability, reducing it to 42% in the toxic control group. This confirms the effectiveness of the toxicity induction protocol and reflects severe cellular damage. )
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [15]
>>
